---
description: The web UI in web/. Vanilla JS, no build step.
globs: web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- No frameworks and no build step: `index.html`, `styles.css`, `app.js` are served as-is by
  `lastday/server.py` under `/static`.
- Colours and type come from the CSS custom properties at the top of `styles.css`. The departures board
  (dark slate, sodium-yellow split-flap digits) is the one bold element; keep the rest quiet.
- Labels are sentence case. Critical, at risk and covered always use `--critical`, `--atrisk` and
  `--covered`, and every label is also written out in words (never colour alone).
- Escape everything from the API with `esc()` before putting it in HTML.
- Check the UI at 390 px wide and in dark mode before committing: `python scripts/screenshots.py`.
